cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this chemical patent analysis system in research, cite the software and the exact commit."
title: "Chemical Patent Analysis: an open-source FTO evidence pipeline"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "McCann-Strain"
    given-names: "Peter"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Peter-McCann-Strain/chemical-patent-analysis"
url: "https://github.com/Peter-McCann-Strain/chemical-patent-analysis"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - patent analytics
  - freedom to operate
  - cheminformatics
  - optical chemical structure recognition
  - evidence provenance
  - research software
abstract: >-
  An open-source research system for structured, counsel-supervised chemical
  patent evidence: compound resolution, patent retrieval and family grouping,
  claim mapping, optical chemical structure recognition, deterministic checks,
  human review, and report generation. It is not legal advice and does not
  provide a freedom-to-operate opinion.
